  "pdf_cells": [
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          568.3268403361344,
          69.01270219714968,
          267.2014962184875,
          13.3226018408551
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/GillSans-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "CHAIRMAN’ S REPORT"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46705386554623,
          139.24466745843233,
          680.2005738655462,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Director of the Clough Group and a highly experienced and talented executive. Richard has"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46705386554623,
          160.18322624703092,
          680.2163364705882,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "appointed an alternate director, Mr Chris Sutherland, a senior Clough Executive, with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46705386554623,
          181.12177286223277,
          491.8734478151261,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "engineering qualifications and associated business skills to assist him."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46705386554623,
          222.99762440617576,
          679.9439104201681,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Captain Jim Carver, Mermaid’s founder continues to play a significant role in Mermaid’s operations,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          243.93617102137773,
          679.9492318067228,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "paying particular attention to our business at sea. Under 20 years of Jim’s leadership, Mermaid"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          264.8747298099762,
          679.9282012184874,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "developed an enviable reputation as a “can do” company, and in our drive for new engineering"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          285.8132885985749,
          601.4014869327731,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "expertise and professionalism, we have no intention of allowing that attitude to be lost."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          327.68912796912116,
          680.2093613025211,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Last year we identified Broome as our next strategic position. No oil and gas work had been"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          348.62768675771974,
          680.2023155042017,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "supported out of Broome for seventeen years and with the valuable cooperation and assistance"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          369.5662333729217,
          680.2181470168067,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of the Broome Port Authority, we secured Inpex, the large Japanese resource company as our first"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          390.5047921615202,
          378.1336096218488,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "client. The base was then established early this year. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          432.38068022565324,
          680.2111012184874,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "A new focus has developed in the Browse Basin and it is pleasing to report that after only seven"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          453.3192268408551,
          680.1881205462186,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "months operation, our Base is profitable, housing Inpex, BHP, Woodside and Sedco in support"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          474.2577856294537,
          680.2286554201681,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of their current drilling programs. All the holes drilled from the Broome Base have been"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          495.19634441805226,
          680.2269155042017,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "designated as commercial finds by the explorers and the very major increase in the reserves at"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          516.1348910332542,
          680.2128411344538,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Brecknock, Woodside’s permit 500 kilometres north of Broome creates optimism for future"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          537.0734498218528,
          268.7426982773109,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "production based in the Broome area."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          578.9505552256533,
          680.2093096218488,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Darwin was next on our list, enabling involvement in Timor Sea oil and gas activity. The Bayu"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          599.8891140142518,
          680.2145638235295,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Undan project operated by Phillips, is well advanced and will impact Darwin’s offshore activity"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          620.8276606294537,
          680.2269155042017,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "quite soon. Pursuing the formula for a strategic sea/land interface, we reached agreement with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          641.7662194180523,
          680.2163554201682,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Perkins Shipping in Darwin, to set up an office at their Frances Drive facility. Perkins Shipping"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46872315126052,
          662.7047782066509,
          680.2022638235295,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is synonymous with Darwin’s history. Set up by V.B. Perkins in the late 40’s, it has grown to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          683.6433248218527,
          680.2391776050422,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "significant size, operating its ships across the top of Australia and into South East Asia. There"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          704.5818836104513,
          680.2181435714285,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "are many synergies which Mermaid shares with Perkins and we look forward to developing our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          725.5204302256532,
          465.2193633193278,
          11.820867280285029
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Darwin business in close association with that fine old Company."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          767.3963182897862,
          680.1899603781515,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our ambitions for the support of the oil and gas industry now go beyond bases and vessels. Early"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          788.3348770783848,
          680.2057402100841,
          11.820855106888388
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "in the current financial year, Mermaid acquired 50% of the OIS MOC Joint Venture Pty Ltd, to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          809.2734236935867,
          680.2004860084035,
          11.820867280285029
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "be paid for by the issue of 800,000 Mermaid shares. OIS MOC owns the highly successful labour"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          830.2119824821852,
          680.1935435714286,
          11.820855106888388
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "hire business operated by Kevin Ponga and Rick De Franck. Kevin Ponga is now General"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          851.1505412707838,
          680.2128376890757,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Manager of Mermaid Labour & Management Pty Limited and Mr De Franck becomes a Director."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.46698668067228,
          872.0890878859857,
          680.2110977731093,
          11.820855106888388
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "With their reputation and talent added to Mermaid’s experienced team, this labour hire"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.4652519327731,
          893.0276466745843,
          680.2145724369749,
          11.820847802850338
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "company has become a significant force and can be expected to be in the final when major"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          149.4652519327731,
          913.9661993764846,
          202.22954386554622,
          11.820850237529683
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "labour hire contracts are let."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          907.3752722689076,
          937.9907702197149,
          7.7521008403361975,
          9.991923990498805
        ],
